  "body": [
    "Careers",
    "International Careers",
    "With a presence in EMEA, APAC, and LATAM, we offer exciting career opportunities across the globe. Whether you’re in Buenos Aires, London, Poland, South Africa, Sydney or Tokyo, you’ll be part of a collaborative team working with colleagues from around the world to shape the future of entertainment.",
